OL,3,AMaura Higgins to fill Cilla Black's
OL,4,Ashoes as host of Blind Date reboot
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaura Higgins is set to follow in the
OL,7,Ffootsteps of the late Cilla Black as
OL,8,Fpresenter of Blind Date in a reboot of
OL,9,Fthe popular TV show.
OL,11,FThe Irish TV personality rose to fame
OL,12,Fin 2019 as a finalist on another dating
OL,13,Fshow, Love Island, and more recently
OL,14,Fappeared on the US version of The
OL,15,FTraitors.
OL,17,FThe original Blind Date launched on ITV
OL,18,Fin 1985 and was a staple of Saturday
OL,19,Fnight TV for nearly 20 years, with
OL,20,Fwell-liked Liverpudlian singer and
OL,21,Factress Black its host.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
